%%HP: T(3)A(D)F(.);
\<< STD
  IFERR CLEAR
"Press the letter that
 corresponds to the
       knowns

[A] Point and y-intcpt
[G] Point and slope
[M] Two points"
1 DISP 3 FREEZE 0
WAIT { 11.1 21.1
31.1 } SWAP POS {
PT\^oB PT\^oM PT\^oPT }
SWAP GET EVAL 'y=M*
x+B' EVAL \->Q { P M
B } PURGE 1 MENU
  THEN BAD
  END
\>>
